      <h1>How to Adjust Your W-4 to Get More Money in Every Paycheck</h1>
      <div class="article-meta"><span>Sep 24, 2026</span><span>·</span><span>7 min read</span></div>
      <p class="article-intro">Did you get a $4,000 tax refund this spring? That isn't free money from the government—it's an interest-free loan you gave the IRS. Here is how to adjust your Form W-4 to put that cash directly into your biweekly paycheck instead.</p>
    </div>
